{
  "slug": "blackrock-advisor-center-plugin",
  "name": "Blackrock Advisor Center Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "BlackRock Advisor Center 360° skills for financial advisors: portfolio review, opportunity and fund-health checks, guided benchmark selection, guided portfolio building, wealth projections, and routing to Advisor Center web workflows. Requires the BlackRock Advisor Center connector and an Advisor Center account.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `ac360-capability-router` (Routes Advisor Center workflow requests that belong in the web experience or cannot be completed by another loaded…), `guided-benchmark-selection` (Helps choose or confirm a benchmark subject for portfolio comparison), `guided-portfolio-builder` (Builds, imports, modifies or clones portfolios after the advisor confirms the holdings and write action), `portfolio-observations-and-opportunities` (Reviews returned portfolio opportunity checks, fund-health details, Funds to Explore, and approved follow-up links), `portfolio-review` (Reviews a saved portfolio, household or model with Advisor Center analytics in three sections rendered inline in the…), `wealth-projections` (Explains modeled performance, projected wealth, methodology, advisory-fee treatment, and unsupported performance or projection requests)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `blackrock-advisor-center`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install blackrock-advisor-center-plugin@claude-plugins-official` from `blackrock/advisor-center-agent-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
